HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ppppppooeedd utility was written by Brian Somers <_b_r_i_a_n_@_A_w_f_u_l_h_a_k_._o_r_g> and
     first appeared in FreeBSD 3.4.

BBUUGGSS
     If another netgraph node is using the given interface, ppppppooeedd will fail
     to start.  This is because netgraph(4) does not currently allow node
     chaining.  This may change in the future.

